Software bills of materials (SBOMs) for Python distributions.
python-sbom writes a CycloneDX SBOM into every wheel you build,
where PEP 770 (a Python Enhancement Proposal) tells installers to
keep it. The SBOM records your project, the runtime dependencies
it declares, any wheels it bundles, and the build toolchain, and
a rebuild with the same inputs reproduces it byte for byte.
